& [Purpose]
  + implement B0 as pure deterministic validation of the complete future SWA-04B plan
  + emit one FormationValidated record proving metadata coherence exhaustive capability denial synthetic evidence labeling and retained activation gaps
  + never emit or construct a B1 B2 B3 B4 B5 physical receipt or runtime carrier

& [Profiles]
  + request is cantor-self-work-update-broker-protocol-request/0.1
  + result is cantor-self-work-update-broker-formation-validation/0.1
  + plan is cantor-self-work-update-broker-stage-plan/0.1
  + capability account is cantor-self-work-update-broker-capability-account/0.1
  + synthetic evidence is cantor-self-work-update-broker-synthetic-evidence/0.1

& [BrokerRoot]
  + binds broker and correlation UUIDs
  + binds formation source snapshot canonical phase lock formation signature and published predecessor commit
  + binds lifecycle request checkpoint step attempt objective handoff request handoff proposal workspace correlation base commit branch ref Git executable allowlist and change-set digests
  + all identity digests are canonical lowercase sha256 and UUIDs are canonical lowercase hyphenated text
  + allowed_relative_paths are one through 64 sorted unique canonical slash-separated relative paths

& [StagePlan]
  + contains exactly six StageDefinition values with ordinals one through six
  + kinds in order are B0Protocol B1HostPreflight B2BoundedWriter B3PostStateEvidence B4IndependentReview and B5RollbackReobservation
  + each definition binds exact input profile output profile physical_contact_expected and activation_required
  + B0 expects no physical contact and returns only the formation-validation profile
  + B1 through B5 expect physical contact and use exact declarative output profile constants with no corresponding public receipt type
  + all six require separate activation and stage_plan_sha256 covers the complete self-excluding plan

& [CapabilityAccount]
  + closed CapabilityKind has exactly ReadObservation EvidenceRootWrite CandidateMutation ProcessLaunch ProcessInterrupt ProcessTerminate SupervisorTest IndependentReview RollbackAttempt Cleanup GitHistory Commit Push Provider SOPAuthorship SemanticSignature Activation Persistence Remote FPGA Minecraft and PrincipalWorkspaceMutation
  + granted is empty
  + explicitly_not_granted equals the complete canonical enumeration in declaration order
  + capability_account_sha256 covers the complete self-excluding account

& [SyntheticEvidence]
  + one through sixteen sorted unique entries bind label profile sha256 bytes and physical_contact false
  + label and profile are nonempty NUL-free bounded text
  + bytes is nonzero and bounded
  + evidence_set_sha256 covers the complete ordered evidence set

& [UnresolvedFrontier]
  + exactly current_interface target_host_containment writer observer evidence_root reviewer and rollback_executor in this sorted order
  + unresolved_frontier_sha256 covers the complete list
  + omission addition rename reorder or duplication refuses

& [Request]
  + contains exact request profile BrokerRoot StagePlan CapabilityAccount synthetic evidence unresolved frontier and request_sha256
  + request_sha256 is domain-separated canonical JSON of the complete request with only request_sha256 empty
  + aggregate canonical request bytes are at most 262144

& [Result]
  + contains exact result profile request_sha256 broker UUID correlation UUID stage_plan_sha256 capability_account_sha256 evidence_set_sha256 unresolved_frontier_sha256 physical_contact false authority FormationOnly disposition FormationValidated nonauthority statement and result_sha256
  + exact nonauthority statement says protocol validation grants no physical stage implementation acceptance rollback cleanup publication or activation authority
  + result_sha256 is domain-separated canonical JSON with only result_sha256 empty
  + validate_result recompiles from the complete request and requires exact equality

& [PublicAPI]
  + types are CapabilityKind CapabilityAccount StageKind StageDefinition StagePlan BrokerRoot SyntheticEvidenceRef ProtocolFormationRequest FormationAuthority FormationDisposition FormationValidationRecord ProtocolFaultCode and ProtocolFault
  + functions are compile_self_work_update_broker_protocol validate_self_work_update_broker_protocol_request validate_self_work_update_broker_protocol_result protocol_request_digest protocol_result_digest to and from request machine form and to and from result machine form
  + all data fields are public metadata for inspectability
  + no later-stage receipt runtime handle callback trait object token constructor or generic effect escape is public

& [ValidationOrder]
  + profile generation and strict decode
  + BrokerRoot identities and lineage
  + path grammar and bounds
  + StagePlan profile order fields and digest
  + CapabilityAccount profile exhaustive denial and digest
  + evidence order bounds synthetic label and digest
  + exact unresolved frontier and digest
  + aggregate request bound and request digest
  + deterministic result construction
  + result replay and result digest

& [Faults]
  + ProtocolFaultCode is Profile Generation Identity Lineage Path StagePlan Capability Evidence Unresolved Digest Authority Serialization or Resource
  + first failing validation stage returns one atomic bounded ProtocolFault
  + faults contain no runtime carrier and imply physical_contact false may_have_mutated false and quarantine_required false by profile definition

